Usage: cardano-cli debug certificate view [--output-json | --output-yaml]
                                            [--out-file FILEPATH]
                                            --certificate-file FILEPATH
                                            

  Print a certificate.

Available options:
  --output-json            Format certificate view output to JSON (default).
  --output-yaml            Format certificate view output to YAML.
  --out-file FILEPATH      Optional output file. Default is to write to stdout.
  --certificate-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the certificate. Use `-` to read
                           from standard input.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
